OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly     
OL,6,Fcloudy night with showers in the east, 
OL,7,Fmainly Angus. Further west will be     
OL,8,Fdrier and colder with some clear       
OL,9,Fintervals allowing a frost to form.    
OL,11,CThursday:FA mostly cloudy day with     
OL,12,Fsome brighter intervals. A few showers 
OL,13,Faround the east in the morning but     
OL,14,Fthese gradually easing, remaining dry  
OL,15,Felsewhere. Winds strengthening.        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
