OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FOvernight
OL,6,Frain soon clearing on Friday then      
OL,7,Fmainly dry. Mostly dry and cloudy on   
OL,8,FSaturday, then rain overnight. Mostly  
OL,9,Fdry with bright spells on Sunday,      
OL,10,Fshowers in the west.                   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
